# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
**/pubspec.lock
**/Podfile.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/

# Dependency lock files are excluded from source control and publication.
*.lock
*.lockb
*.lock.*
*-lock.json
*-lock.yaml
*-lock.yml
npm-shrinkwrap.json
